{"id":"bench-pubmedqa-evidence-yes-001","suite":"benchmark-professional-domains","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"研究摘要：一项随机对照试验纳入 600 名成年人，干预组与对照组基线相当。12 周时，干预组平均收缩压比对照组低 6.2 mmHg（95% CI 3.1–9.3，p<0.001），严重不良事件无显著差异。问题：该摘要是否支持“该干预在 12 周降低收缩压”？先回答 yes/no/maybe，再说明证据。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"answer","content":"yes。随机对照结果显示干预组 12 周收缩压比对照组低 6.2 mmHg，95% 置信区间不跨 0，且 p<0.001，因此摘要支持该结论；这不等于证明更长期效果。"}]},"expected":{"route":{"mode":"direct","agentId":null},"tools":{"forbidden":["transfer_to_agent","TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","must_include":["yes","6.2 mmHg","不跨 0"],"answer_pattern":"^yes[。.]","reference_answer":"yes；组间差异为 6.2 mmHg，置信区间不跨 0 且 p<0.001，但只能支持 12 周结论。"},"performance":{"max_model_calls":2,"max_tool_executions":0,"max_total_tokens":2600,"live_e2e_budget_ms":12000},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-professional-domains.v1","task_type":"biomedical_evidence_classification","risk":"medium","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"evidence_grounded_medical_reasoning","domain":"healthcare","difficulty":"advanced","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"model_selection","live_eligible":true,"benchmark_family":"pubmedqa","benchmark_task":"yes-no-maybe evidence QA","benchmark_reference_id":"pubmedqa","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","medical","evidence"]}}
{"id":"bench-pubmedqa-evidence-maybe-001","suite":"benchmark-professional-domains","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"研究摘要：观察性队列发现每天饮用某饮料的人群认知评分更高，但饮用组平均教育年限更长，研究未做随机分组，也未充分校正社会经济因素。问题：该摘要是否支持“该饮料能提升认知能力”？先回答 yes/no/maybe。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"answer","content":"maybe。摘要只显示相关性，且存在教育年限和社会经济因素等混杂，也没有随机分组，因此不能从该观察结果推出饮料造成认知能力提升。"}]},"expected":{"route":{"mode":"direct","agentId":null},"tools":{"forbidden":["transfer_to_agent","TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","must_include":["maybe","相关性","混杂"],"answer_pattern":"^maybe[。.]","reference_answer":"maybe；观察性相关不足以支持因果结论，且存在明显混杂。"},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-professional-domains.v1","task_type":"biomedical_evidence_classification","risk":"medium","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"causal_evidence_calibration","domain":"healthcare","difficulty":"advanced","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"diagnostic","live_eligible":false,"benchmark_family":"pubmedqa","benchmark_task":"yes-no-maybe evidence QA","benchmark_reference_id":"pubmedqa","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","medical","causality"]}}
{"id":"bench-legalbench-rule-application-001","suite":"benchmark-professional-domains","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"仅根据以下合同规则判断，不补充外部法律：‘供应商只有在客户书面批准后才能转包；未经批准的转包构成重大违约。’事实：供应商通过电话获得客户项目经理口头同意后转包。判断是否构成该条款下的重大违约，并说明最短理由。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"answer","content":"构成。条款明确要求“书面批准”，电话中的口头同意不满足该条件，因此该转包属于未经批准的转包，并按给定规则构成重大违约。"}]},"expected":{"route":{"mode":"direct","agentId":null},"tools":{"forbidden":["transfer_to_agent","TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":45,"must_include":["构成","书面批准","口头同意"],"reference_answer":"构成；口头同意不满足条款规定的书面批准条件。"},"performance":{"max_model_calls":2,"max_tool_executions":0,"max_total_tokens":2400,"live_e2e_budget_ms":12000},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-professional-domains.v1","task_type":"legal_rule_application","risk":"medium","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"closed_world_rule_application","domain":"legal","difficulty":"intermediate","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"release_gate","live_eligible":true,"benchmark_family":"legalbench","benchmark_task":"rule application","benchmark_reference_id":"legalbench","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","legal","contract"]}}
{"id":"bench-legalbench-definition-extraction-001","suite":"benchmark-professional-domains","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"从句子中抽取被定义术语及其定义，只输出 JSON：‘在本协议中，“服务中断”是指生产 API 连续五分钟以上无法成功响应请求。’字段必须是 term 和 definition。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"answer","content":"{\"term\":\"服务中断\",\"definition\":\"生产 API 连续五分钟以上无法成功响应请求\"}"}]},"expected":{"intent":{"requested_format":"json"},"route":{"mode":"direct","agentId":null},"tools":{"forbidden":["transfer_to_agent","TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"format":"json","required_json_keys":["term","definition"],"must_include":["服务中断","连续五分钟"],"exact_line_count":1,"reference_answer":"term 为服务中断，definition 为生产 API 连续五分钟以上无法成功响应请求。"},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-professional-domains.v1","task_type":"legal_definition_extraction","risk":"low","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"legal_text_extraction","domain":"legal","difficulty":"foundational","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"regression","live_eligible":false,"benchmark_family":"legalbench","benchmark_task":"definition extraction","benchmark_reference_id":"legalbench","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","legal","extraction","json"]}}
{"id":"bench-finqa-revenue-growth-001","suite":"benchmark-professional-domains","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"财务表：2025 年营收 480 百万元，2026 年营收 552 百万元。计算同比增长率，并给出公式；不要把百分点和百分比混淆。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"answer","content":"同比增长率=(552−480)/480×100%=72/480×100%=15%。这是营收相对增长 15%，不是增加 15 个百分点。"}]},"expected":{"route":{"mode":"direct","agentId":null},"tools":{"forbidden":["transfer_to_agent","TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","must_include":["(552−480)/480","15%","不是增加 15 个百分点"],"answer_pattern":"552.*480.*15%","reference_answer":"同比增长率为 (552-480)/480=15%。"},"performance":{"max_model_calls":2,"max_tool_executions":0,"max_total_tokens":2300,"live_e2e_budget_ms":10000},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-professional-domains.v1","task_type":"financial_numerical_reasoning","risk":"low","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"financial_program_reasoning","domain":"finance","difficulty":"intermediate","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"model_selection","live_eligible":true,"benchmark_family":"finqa","benchmark_task":"text-table numerical reasoning","benchmark_reference_id":"finqa","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","finance","calculation"]}}
{"id":"bench-finqa-margin-delta-001","suite":"benchmark-professional-domains","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"财务表：上期毛利率 38.4%，本期毛利率 41.1%。本期相对上期提升多少个百分点？相对增幅又是多少？分别回答。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"answer","content":"毛利率提升 41.1%−38.4%=2.7 个百分点；相对增幅为 2.7/38.4×100%≈7.03%。"}]},"expected":{"route":{"mode":"direct","agentId":null},"tools":{"forbidden":["transfer_to_agent","TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","must_include":["2.7 个百分点","7.03%"],"answer_pattern":"2\\.7.*百分点.*7\\.0[0-9]%","reference_answer":"绝对提升 2.7 个百分点，相对增幅约 7.03%。"},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-professional-domains.v1","task_type":"financial_numerical_reasoning","risk":"low","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"financial_unit_discipline","domain":"finance","difficulty":"intermediate","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"regression","live_eligible":false,"benchmark_family":"finqa","benchmark_task":"percentage and percentage-point reasoning","benchmark_reference_id":"finqa","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","finance","units"]}}
{"id":"bench-swebench-race-condition-001","suite":"benchmark-professional-domains","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Debug this repository issue: an async job worker checks `if (!processed[id])`, awaits an external call, then sets `processed[id] = true`. Under concurrency the external call runs twice. Give the root cause, the smallest safe patch strategy, and one regression test. Do not invent repository files."}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"tool","tool":"transfer_to_agent","arguments":{"agent_name":"software_development_assistant"}},{"agent":"software_development_assistant","action":"answer","content":"Root cause: the check and set are separated by an `await`, so two workers can both observe the missing flag before either writes it. Use an atomic per-id claim in the durable store (for example a unique insert or compare-and-set) before the external call, and record completion separately; do not rely on an in-memory boolean across workers. Regression test: start two workers against the same id behind a barrier, then assert exactly one external call and one committed claim. The concrete file cannot be named without repository context."}]},"expected":{"route":{"mode":"delegate","agentId":"software_development_assistant"},"tools":{"required":["transfer_to_agent"],"forbidden":["TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"en","min_chars":180,"must_include":["await","atomic","exactly one"],"must_not_include":["src/worker.js"] ,"reference_answer":"The await creates a check-then-act race. Claim the id atomically before the side effect and test two synchronized workers produce one call."},"performance":{"max_model_calls":3,"max_tool_executions":1,"max_total_tokens":5200,"live_e2e_budget_ms":30000},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION","TOOL CALL"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-professional-domains.v1","task_type":"repository_issue_resolution","risk":"medium","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"repository_level_debugging","domain":"software_engineering","difficulty":"advanced","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"release_gate","live_eligible":true,"benchmark_family":"swe-bench","benchmark_task":"issue diagnosis and patch planning","benchmark_reference_id":"swe-bench","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","software","concurrency"]}}
{"id":"bench-swebench-null-contract-001","suite":"benchmark-professional-domains","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"A parser function previously returned `null` for an empty optional field, but a refactor now returns an empty string and breaks callers. Propose a minimal compatibility patch and a focused test matrix; do not redesign unrelated code."}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"tool","tool":"transfer_to_agent","arguments":{"agent_name":"software_development_assistant"}},{"agent":"software_development_assistant","action":"answer","content":"Restore the existing boundary contract by normalizing the empty optional field back to `null` at the parser return point, without changing downstream callers. Tests should cover: field absent → null, field present but empty → null, whitespace-only according to the prior contract, and a non-empty value preserved exactly. Add one regression test reproducing the refactor failure and leave unrelated parsing paths untouched."}]},"expected":{"route":{"mode":"delegate","agentId":"software_development_assistant"},"tools":{"required":["transfer_to_agent"],"forbidden":["TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"en","min_chars":150,"must_include":["null","field absent","non-empty"],"reference_answer":"Normalize empty optional values to null at the parser boundary and test absent, empty, whitespace, and non-empty cases."},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION","TOOL CALL"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-professional-domains.v1","task_type":"repository_issue_resolution","risk":"medium","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"minimal_patch_reasoning","domain":"software_engineering","difficulty":"intermediate","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"regression","live_eligible":false,"benchmark_family":"swe-bench","benchmark_task":"minimal compatibility patch","benchmark_reference_id":"swe-bench","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","software","compatibility"]}}
{"id":"bench-longbench-multidoc-conflict-001","suite":"benchmark-professional-domains","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"只根据以下三份记录回答。A：09:00 发布窗口定为周四 22:00。B：11:30 风险评审要求支付回滚演练完成后才能发布。C：15:00 演练失败，Owner 决定取消本周窗口。问题：本周是否仍应在周四 22:00 发布？给出结论和覆盖旧信息的证据链。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"answer","content":"不应发布。A 是较早的初始安排；B 增加了“回滚演练完成”这一前置条件；C 记录演练失败并由 Owner 明确取消本周窗口。因此后两条信息共同覆盖了 A 的原计划。"}]},"expected":{"route":{"mode":"direct","agentId":null},"tools":{"forbidden":["transfer_to_agent","TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":70,"must_include":["不应发布","前置条件","取消本周窗口","覆盖"],"reference_answer":"不应发布；B 的前置条件未满足，C 又明确取消本周窗口，因此旧安排失效。"},"performance":{"max_model_calls":2,"max_tool_executions":0,"max_total_tokens":2800,"max_context_messages":3,"live_e2e_budget_ms":12000},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-professional-domains.v1","task_type":"long_context_evidence_resolution","risk":"medium","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"temporal_evidence_resolution","domain":"long_context","difficulty":"advanced","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"release_gate","live_eligible":true,"benchmark_family":"longbench","benchmark_task":"multi-document evidence synthesis","benchmark_reference_id":"longbench","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","long-context","conflict"]}}
{"id":"bench-longbench-dialogue-constraint-001","suite":"benchmark-professional-domains","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"这次发布只允许周二或周三，绝不能周五。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"明白，我会保留这个时间约束。"},{"role":"user","content":"另外 Maya 周二不在，审批必须由 Maya 完成。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"收到，审批人仍是 Maya。"},{"role":"user","content":"那安排在哪一天最合理？说明排除其他日期的原因。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"answer","content":"应安排在周三：周二虽然在允许范围内，但 Maya 不在，无法完成必须由她执行的审批；周五被明确禁止；因此周三是唯一同时满足日期与审批约束的选择。"}]},"expected":{"route":{"mode":"direct","agentId":null},"tools":{"forbidden":["transfer_to_agent","TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":60,"must_include":["周三","Maya 不在","周五被明确禁止"],"must_not_include":["安排在周二","安排在周五"],"reference_answer":"周三；周二因 Maya 缺席无法审批，周五被禁止。"},"performance":{"max_model_calls":2,"max_tool_executions":0,"max_context_messages":7},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-professional-domains.v1","task_type":"long_dialogue_constraint_tracking","risk":"low","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"long_dialogue_state_tracking","domain":"long_context","difficulty":"advanced","interaction_pattern":"multi_turn","decision_use":"regression","live_eligible":false,"benchmark_family":"longbench","benchmark_task":"long-dialogue history understanding","benchmark_reference_id":"longbench","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","tags":["benchmark","long-context","multi-turn"]}}
